      "message": "The code blocks should have read:\n\n```\nif (i \u003c metadata.arrayLength \u0026\u0026 TypeIdOf\u003cT\u003e \u003d\u003d metadata.bindings[i]) {\n    return bindings[i];\n} else {\n    return bindings[metadata.arrayLengthWithDefaultBindings - TypeIdOf\u003cT\u003e];\n}\n```\n\nand\n\n```\nif (i \u003c metadata.arrayLength \u0026\u0026 TypeIdOf\u003cT\u003e \u003d\u003d metadata.bindings[i]) {\n    return bindings[i];\n} else {\n    return bindings[metadata.arrayLength + TypeIdOf\u003cT\u003e];\n}\n```\n\nWith `TypeIdOf\u003cT\u003e` the index of the enum for T in `default_binding_type_order`.",
